  "term": "autism spectrum disorder",
  "definition": "Autism spectrum disorder is a broad range of related cognitive and neurobehavioral conditions marked by difficulties with social interaction and with verbal and nonverbal communication, along with restricted and repetitive behaviors. It is described as a spectrum because these features can vary across individuals.",
